    "name_raw": "Squirming Pile",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat, Teamwork",
    "source_book_raw": "Blood of the Beast pg. 23",
    "definition_raw": "Source Blood of the Beast pg. 23\nYour body is easily lost in the muddy chaos of fighting as a swarm, making your vital areas difficult to target.\n\nPrerequisites: Acrobatics 5 ranks, swarming racial trait.\n\nBenefit: While sharing a square with an ally who has this feat, you gain a 25% chance of negating the additional damage from a successful critical hit or sneak attack; if you negate the damage, it is instead rolled normally. This negation chance doesn’t stack with similar protection provided by any other source, such as the fortification armor special ability.",
